                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "Data from: Komossa F, van der Zanden EH, Schulp CJE, Verburg PH. 2018. Mapping landscape potential for outdoor recreation using different archetypical recreation user groups in the European Union. Ecological Indicators 85:105-116\n\nThese maps of landscapes’ outdoor recreation potential throughout the EU are based on the different landscape preferences of five archetypical outdoor recreation user groups. They provide a synthesis of available information and data on the differential preferences and patterns for outdoor recreation in the EU."
